    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f <strong>Shadow Sprinter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Dash. Survive.</strong><br>Step into the shadows of a neon-drenched world in <i>Shadow Sprinter</i>, a fast-paced 2D endless runner where precision and instinct are your only allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a daring sprinter escaping high-tech surveillance in a dynamic side-scrolling gauntlet. Vault over shifting platforms, time your double jumps, and unleash rapid-fire dashes to dodge security drones and collapsing paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your momentum\u2014<strong>the world speeds up the longer you survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lastly - Square go brrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Responsive Controls</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up, hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Dash Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Zip forward with a satisfying boost, but time it right\u2014there's a cooldown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Adaptive Difficulty</strong> \u2013 The game gets faster and harder as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Slick Audio Design</strong> \u2013 Jump, land, dash, and die with satisfying sound cues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Gems &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Earn or purchase gems to unlock character upgrades and cosmetics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded1 One Mistake and It\u2019s Over</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touch a wall. Miss a jump. Hesitate. And it\u2019s game over.<br>Can you outrun the system?</p>",
